ompany’s IPO) to the Company’s sponsor and no preferred shares are issued and outstanding. All of the issued share capital of the Company has been duly authorized, validly issued, and are fully paid and non-assessable.","section":"","block":32,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-084616","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-03","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0002114229","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2114229/000121390026084616/ea030008601ex10-3.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/5677dbc9ca0f66e7d7ef9841e02cbacc0731d26b042be5bb5f988c5b9d98ac86.bin","sha256":"5677dbc9ca0f66e7d7ef9841e02cbacc0731d26b042be5bb5f988c5b9d98ac86"}},{"id":"17caff2863347b9f7fa930b39540bdd98cf1cdfe996db0a587326e054c9aff4f","quote":"4.4. Registration Rights. The Purchaser will be entitled to certain registration rights which will be governed by a registration rights agreement (“Registration Rights Agreement”) to be entered into with the Company on or prior to the closing of the IPO.","context":"4","section":"","block":44,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-084616","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-03","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0002114229","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2114229/000121390026084616/ea030008601ex10-3.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/5677dbc9ca0f66e7d7ef9841e02cbacc0731d26b042be5bb5f988c5b9d98ac86.bin","sha256":"5677dbc9ca0f66e7d7ef9841e02cbacc0731d26b042be5bb5f988c5b9d98ac86"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"riskFactors":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"segmentIntelligence":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0}},"warnings":[]},{"version":1,"source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-084616","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-03","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0002114229","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/ed